{"title":"广东省住建厅印发重要通知，自发布之日起实施！涉全省房屋市政工程！","date":"2025-01-08","content":"<section class=\"article135\" data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\">\r\n\t<section data-color=\"#1e9be8\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; height: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t<h1 class=\"rich_media_title\" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: center; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">广东省住建厅印发重要通知，自发布之日起实施！涉全省房屋市政工程！</span></h1>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\">\r\n\t\t<section data-role=\"paragraph\">\r\n\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align:justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-size: 18px;font-family:sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1月3日，广东省住建厅印发《广东省房屋建筑和市政基础设施工程事故应急预案》（粤办函〔2024〕325号）。本预案自发布之日起实施。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-backh=\"263\" data-backw=\"578\" data-imgfileid=\"100012807\" data-ratio=\"0.4546296296296296\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202501/%E5%9B%BE3-1.png\" style=\"width: 1080px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; height: 491px;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"126868\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: 20px;margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;margin-bottom: -15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;transform: translateZ(10px);-webkit-transform: translateZ(10px);-moz-transform: translateZ(10px);-o-transform: translateZ(10px);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 100%; background-image: linear-gradient(to right bottom, #43bf47, #ffdcd1); background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>0</strong><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\">1</strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: 12px;margin-left: -15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #00b050; padding: 4px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong data-brushtype=\"text\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 1.3 适用范围</span></strong></strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #00b050;padding: 25px 15px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2.16666em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">本预案适用于广东省行政区域内房屋市政工程施工过程中，造成人员伤亡或者重大直接经济损失的事故应急准备、监测与预警、应急处置与救援等防范应对工作。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: 20px;margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;margin-bottom: -15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;transform: translateZ(10px);-webkit-transform: translateZ(10px);-moz-transform: translateZ(10px);-o-transform: translateZ(10px);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 100%; background-image: linear-gradient(to right bottom, #43bf47, #ffdcd1); background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>0</strong><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\">2</strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: 12px;margin-left: -15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #00b050; padding: 4px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong data-brushtype=\"text\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 4.1 事故报告</span></strong></strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #00b050;padding: 25px 15px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.2em\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%;font-family:sans-serif;\">房屋市政工程事故发生后</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%;font-family:sans-serif;\">，<strong>建设、施工单位要在1小时内报告</strong>工程所在地县级以上房屋市政工程建设主管部门、应急管理部门。接报的房屋市政工程建设主管部门要立即核实有关情况，报告同级人民政府，并按规定逐级上报至省住房城乡建设厅。省住房城乡建设厅将事故信息报送住房城乡建设部，其中，较大及以上事故信息要同时报送省政府、省安全生产委员会办公室。<span style=\"color: red;\">每级上报时间不得超过1小时，情况紧急时可以越级上报。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: 20px;margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;margin-bottom: -15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;transform: translateZ(10px);-webkit-transform: translateZ(10px);-moz-transform: translateZ(10px);-o-transform: translateZ(10px);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 100%; background-image: linear-gradient(to right bottom, #43bf47, #ffdcd1); background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>0</strong><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\">3</strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: 12px;margin-left: -15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #00b050; padding: 4px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong data-brushtype=\"text\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 4.2 先期处置</span></strong></strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #00b050;padding: 25px 15px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.16666em\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">房屋市政工程事故发生后，<strong>发生事故的工程建设、施工、监理等单位</strong>在政府有关部门救援力量到达前，第一时间启动本单位应急预案，<span style=\"line-height: 115%; color: red;\">立即组织本单位应急队伍，在保护好事故现场</span>，保持现场重要物证、痕迹，以及在确保应急救援人员人身安全和避免次生事故发生的前提下，<span style=\"line-height: 115%; color: red;\">锁定受困人员位置信息并设法营救，紧急转移、疏散或者撤离受到威胁的人员，并妥善安置，控制危险源，标明、封锁危险区域，及时采取防止危害扩大的必要措施。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: 20px;margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;margin-bottom: -15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;transform: translateZ(10px);-webkit-transform: translateZ(10px);-moz-transform: translateZ(10px);-o-transform: translateZ(10px);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 100%; background-image: linear-gradient(to right bottom, #43bf47, #ffdcd1); background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>0</strong><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\">4</strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: 12px;margin-left: -15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #00b050; padding: 4px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong data-brushtype=\"text\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 6.5 资金保障</span></strong></strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #00b050;padding: 25px 15px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2.16666em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">房屋市政工程建设、施工单位做好事故应急救援必要的资金准备，<strong>事故应急处置所需费用首先由事故施工单位承担</strong>。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: 20px;margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;margin-bottom: -15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;transform: translateZ(10px);-webkit-transform: translateZ(10px);-moz-transform: translateZ(10px);-o-transform: translateZ(10px);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 100%; background-image: linear-gradient(to right bottom, #43bf47, #ffdcd1); background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>0</strong><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\">5</strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: 12px;margin-left: -15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #00b050; padding: 4px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong data-brushtype=\"text\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 6.6 电力保障</span></strong></strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #00b050;padding: 25px 15px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2.16666em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">施工单位按要求在工程施工现场配置供电电源和自备应急电源</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">，并加强安全运行检查。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: 20px;margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;margin-bottom: -15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;transform: translateZ(10px);-webkit-transform: translateZ(10px);-moz-transform: translateZ(10px);-o-transform: translateZ(10px);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 100%; background-image: linear-gradient(to right bottom, #43bf47, #ffdcd1); background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>0</strong><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\">6</strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: 12px;margin-left: -15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #00b050; padding: 4px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong data-brushtype=\"text\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 7.2 预案演练</span></strong></strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #00b050;padding: 25px 15px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2.16666em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">房屋市政工程建设、施工、监理单位每半年至少组织开展一次应急演练，不断完善本单位应急预案，提高应急处置水平。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align:justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-backh=\"5001\" data-backw=\"578\" data-imgfileid=\"100012808\" data-ratio=\"8.652430044182621\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"679\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202501/%E5%9B%BE3-2.jpg\" style=\"width: 324px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; height: 2800px;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"117010\" data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #615e5e;margin-right: 12px;margin-left: 12px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #615e5e;margin-right: 12px;margin-left: 12px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>"}